   "text": "<!DOCTYPE HTML>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title>The Visa Bulletin</title></head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"tsg-rwd-main-copy-body-frame\">\n<h1>The Visa Bulletin</h1>\n<div class=\"tsg-rwd-text parbase section\"><div class=\"tsg-rwd-content-page-parsys\">\n<p>The Visa Bulletin summarizes the availability of immigrant numbers. Dates are listed in DAY-MONTH-YEAR (dd-mmm-yy) format.</p>\n<h3>Current Visa Bulletin</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/content/travel/en/legal/visa-law0/visa-bulletin/2027/visa-bulletin-for-october-2026.html\">October 2026</a></li></ul>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"accordion parbase section\"><div class=\"tsg-rwd-accordion\"><div class=\"tsg-rwd-accordion-title\">2027</div>\n<div class=\"tsg-rwd-accordion-copy\"><ul><li><a href=\"/content/travel/en/legal/visa-law0/visa-bulletin/2027/visa-bulletin-for-october-2026.html\">October 2026</a></li></ul></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"accordion parbase section\"><div class=\"tsg-rwd-accordion\"><div class=\"tsg-rwd-accordion-title\">2026</div>\n<div class=\"tsg-rwd-accordion-copy\"><ul><li><a href=\"/content/travel/en/legal/visa-law0/visa-bulletin/2026/visa-bulletin-for-september-2026.html\">September 2026</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/content/travel/en/legal/visa-law0/visa-bulletin/2026/visa-bulletin-for-august-2026.html\">August 2026</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/content/travel/en/legal/visa-law0/visa-bulletin/2026/visa-bulletin-for-july-2026.html\">July 2026</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/content/travel/en/legal/visa-law0/visa-bulletin/2026/visa-bulletin-for-june-2026.html\">June 2026</a></li><li><a href=\"/content/travel/en/legal/visa-law0/visa-bulletin/2026/visa-bulletin-for-october-2025.html\">October 2025</a></li></ul></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</body></html>"
